    "parameter_order_rule": "Use ascending layer index d=0,...,D_ans-1. Within each layer order alpha[d,0:9] for rz on q0 through q8, then beta[d,0:9] for rzz on edges (q0,q1) through (q8,q9), then gamma[d,0:9] for the shared-angle rxx followed by ryy exchange blocks on those same ascending edges. Qiskit conventions are rz(theta)=exp(-i*theta*Z/2) and rpp(theta)=exp(-i*theta*P tensor P/2).",
